@baseUrl = https://localhost:7174
@itemId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@assetId = 1
@bundleId = 1
# Set locally; never commit a real administrative key.
@adminKey =

### Generated contract (Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Offset catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog?page=1&pageSize=24

### Cursor catalog; pass nextCursor unchanged as after on subsequent requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/feed?pageSize=24

### Stored bundle relationships
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/bundles/{{bundleId}}/components

### Parent bundles (array, possibly empty)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/assets/{{assetId}}/bundles

### Item by internal ID (unknown stored item returns 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/items/{{itemId}}

### Stored asset
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/items/by-asset/{{assetId}}

### Stored bundle
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/items/by-bundle/{{bundleId}}

### Legacy history (array, exclusive before timestamp)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/items/{{itemId}}/market-history?limit=100

### Daily sales, UTC date range, exclusive to
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/items/{{itemId}}/market-history/daily-sales?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-20&limit=100

### RAP series
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/items/{{itemId}}/market-history/rap?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-20&limit=100

### Market summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/items/{{itemId}}/market-summary

### Development diagnostics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/infrastructure

### Invalid query: 400 ProblemDetails
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog?page=0

### Administrative import (requires HTTPS and locally supplied key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/imports
X-Liro-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"itemType":"Asset","robloxId":{{assetId}}}

### Compatibility asset import
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/items/import/{{assetId}}
X-Liro-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Compatibility bundle import
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/items/import-bundle/{{bundleId}}
X-Liro-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Create stored item: 201 + Location or 409 if it exists
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/items
X-Liro-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"robloxAssetId":{{assetId}},"name":"Example item","collectibleItemId":null,"marketStatus":1}

### LAN probe: only when enabled, use configured private LAN address on port 5205
# GET http://<configured-lan-address>:5205/api/lan/ready
